   $q$How does the fourth paragraph interact with the third to shape the central idea?$q$, $q$[{"text":"After the third paragraph shows the value of personal accounts, the fourth adds that they need checking, so the central idea joins value with caution.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The fourth paragraph repeats the examples from the third, adding more details about lunch hours on the riverbank.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"The fourth paragraph cancels the third by showing that the interviews were too unreliable to be kept in the library.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"The fourth paragraph proves that the written records were wrong whenever they disagreed with what residents remembered.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$After the third paragraph shows the value of personal accounts, the fourth adds that they need checking, so the central idea joins value with caution.$q$, $q$Paragraph 4 says memories "fade and sometimes shift," and the students noted agreements and differences "rather than choosing one version as the truth," which qualifies the value shown in paragraph 3. The collection was kept and is heavily used, so the second choice is wrong.$q$, 'draft', 'abc639b4-7adb-5242-af70-ee4acc8917c8')
